  "coverage": "Mozambique: 11 provinces & maputo city, 161 districts and 457 administrative posts. Retained HDX COD-AB reference, reviewed 2026. Mozambique population province codes are crosswalked by unique names because the releases use different code rosters; district populations are not assigned across that mismatch. The fourth administrative level is not exposed. Population is separately dated 2025 and never inferred from a national total. All displayed parents dissolve from the same child partition. Inland lakes are excluded. Only shared internal and land frontier lines are drawn; coastlines have no stroke.",
